{"turn_id": "d03-t2", "session_id": "d03", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "dataset_size", "text": "论文指出 FEVER 是最大的数据集，包含约 185k 条 claims，来自 5.4M 篇 Wikipedia 文章的语料。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}, {"key": "label_set", "text": "这些 claims 根据证据集被标注为 “SUPPORTS”、“REFUTES” 或 “NOT ENOUGH INFO”。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}, {"key": "approach", "text": "论文提出一种无监督的问答式方法来处理 fact-checking：通过掩蔽 claims 中提供的命名实体，将 FEVER 数据集转换为 Cloze-task。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7c69a28e7ffcb9ebd09842b6"}]}, {"key": "bert_use", "text": "为预测答案 token，该方法使用预训练的 BERT（Bidirectional Encoder Representations from Transformers）。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7c69a28e7ffcb9ebd09842b6"}]}, {"key": "classifier_labels", "text": "分类器基于正确回答的问题与一个阈值计算标签；目前分类器能够将 claims 分类为 “SUPPORTS” 和 “MANUAL_REVIEW”。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7c69a28e7ffcb9ebd09842b6"}]}, {"key": "reported_accuracy", "text": "该方法在转换后数据集的开发集上达到 80.2% 的标签准确率，在测试集上达到 80.25%。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7c69a28e7ffcb9ebd09842b6"}]}, {"key": "qa_per_claim", "text": "结果显示平均每条 claim 生成 3 个问题；阈值 φ = 0.76 意味着 4 个问题中至少 3 个需要被正确回答，而 φ = 0.67 意味着 3 个问题中至少 2 个需要被正确回答，claim 才能被分类为 “SUPPORTS”。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-41beb2396050f5a800883bfc"}]}, {"key": "manual_review_rationale", "text": "由于 claim 验证过程和问题生成过程都不要求显式推理，因此难以给出 “REFUTES” 或 “NOT ENOUGH INFO” 标签；为处理这一问题，论文将不支持的 claims 分类为 “MANUAL_REVIEW”。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-c1927faa43ced5496949efab"}]}, {"key": "entity_masking", "text": "论文使用 Stanford CoreNLP NER tagger 识别命名实体，然后通过掩蔽这些实体来生成问题，从而将任务转换为 Cloze-task 或掩码语言建模任务。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-c7c17ddf8a10b59543bbe5cd"}]}, {"key": "bert_pretraining", "text": "所用 BERT 的掩码语言模型是在 Wikipedia 文章上预训练的，用于预测被掩蔽的实体。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-c1927faa43ced5496949efab"}]}, {"key": "comparison_hexaf", "text": "作者将 “SUPPORTS” 标签的标签准确率与有监督方法 HexaF 进行比较，结果表明在 φ = 0.76 时该方法与 HexaF 相当。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-41beb2396050f5a800883bfc"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d03-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": false, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
